Umbhalo uma-kufika: ['evaluate'] yenza: {
	>> ikhodi := Ifayela okusha: ['/tmp/eval.ctr'].
	ikhodi bhala: (uqobo umbhalo + ['.']).
	Uhlelo sebenzisa: ['/tmp/eval.ctr'].
}.

>> a := Uhlu ← 1 ; 2 ; 3.
>> b := (a umbhalo).

Okuphumayo bhala: b, umugqa-omusha. 
(['b := '] + b) evaluate.

Okuphumayo bhala: b ? 2, umugqa-omusha. 

Okuphumayo bhala: (( Uhlu ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 )), umugqa-omusha. 

Okuphumayo bhala: ((Isichazamazwi okusha) beka: 1 endaweni: 2), umugqa-omusha. 

>> x := ( (Uhlu ← 1 ; ( Uhlu ← 9 ) ; Iqiniso ) ) umbhalo.
Okuphumayo bhala: x, umugqa-omusha. 
(['x := '] + x) evaluate.

Okuphumayo bhala: x ? 1 ? 0, umugqa-omusha. 

>> y := (Isichazamazwi okusha) beka: (Uhlu ← 1) endaweni: (Uhlu ← 2).
Okuphumayo bhala: y, umugqa-omusha. 

(['y := '] + y) umbhalo evaluate.

Okuphumayo bhala: (y endaweni: (Uhlu ← 2) umbhalo ), umugqa-omusha.

Okuphumayo bhala: (Uhlu okusha), umugqa-omusha. 
Okuphumayo bhala: (Isichazamazwi okusha), umugqa-omusha. 
